00:40:04.550 --> 00:40:10.360
So if you go to
cloud.google.com/genomics/gatk,

00:40:10.360 --> 00:40:13.990
you'll see docs there that help
you just get up and running

00:40:13.990 --> 00:40:16.927
on a sample right away.

00:40:16.927 --> 00:40:19.260
KEITH BINDER: And I believe
the Broad website also has--

00:40:19.260 --> 00:40:19.640
JONATHAN SHEFFI: And
the Broad website

00:40:19.640 --> 00:40:21.020
has a similar URL as well.

00:40:21.020 --> 00:40:21.730
KEITH BINDER: And GATK as well.

00:40:21.730 --> 00:40:23.313
JONATHAN SHEFFI: And
their blog, yeah.

00:40:23.313 --> 00:40:25.200
So both institutions
